{"id":"sh/b25krqpc","kind":"textbox","position":{"left":64,"top":222,"width":698,"height":308},"text":"Curve: y^2 = x^3 + 7 (mod p)\np = 2^256 - 2^32 - 977\nQ = dG  (private key d, public key Q)\n\nz = EIP-712 digest interpreted as an integer\nR = kG\nr = x(R) mod n\ns = k^(-1) * (z + r*d) mod n\n\nsignature = r[32] || s[32] || v[1]\nOpenZeppelin: low-s and v in {27,28}\naddress = last20(keccak256(Q_x || Q_y))","style":{"fontSize":19.51,"typeface":"Consolas","color":"#202C3C","alignment":"left"},"geometry":"rect","lineWidth":0},
